nombreux hommes et femmes considèrent le shilajit comme un complément alimentaire pouvant offrir des avantages </span>nootropiques, un effet énergisant positif et une amélioration générale du bien-être.</p></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1755514754446" class="gf_row gf_equal-height gf_row-gap-7" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1755514754446" data-layout-lg="3+3+3+3" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="3+3+3+3" data-layout-sm="6+6+6+6" data-layout-xs="3+3+3+3" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;" data-row-gap="7px"><div class="gf_column gf_col-xs- gf_col-lg-3 gf_col-md-3 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-3" id="c-1716788410008" data-id="1716788410008" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1755514754378" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1755514754378" style="" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/BENEFIT_BADGE_1080_x_1080_px_4_3000x3000.png?v=1727425212" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="1080" height="1080" natural-width="1080" natural-height="1080"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-3 gf_col-md-3 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-3" id="c-1716788412324" data-id="1716788412324" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1755514754327" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1755514754327" data-resolution="3000x3000" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://cd